notes.content:
Thank You!

First of all, we’d like to thank you for your support and feedback. We are constantly improving the game based on your suggestions. Here’s what’s new in this update;


New Features;

 You can now adjust the sound settings. This option is available in the Settings menu.


Bug Fixes;

 Fixed the camera shaking issue when re-entering the game after ending a run.
 Fixed some visual issues occurring after boss fights.


Your feedback is invaluable to us! Feel free to share your thoughts, and we’ll be back with new content and improvements soon.
Thanks,
Ketz: Galactic Overlords Team
